WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,760 --> 00:00:01,720
What is he here for?

2
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:04,440
Classmate Chen An

3
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:07,760
Could you please let me know if you can explore the trade?

4
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:11,040
you said before

5
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:12,680
Just bring you a gift bag

6
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,880
Just help raise the door to level four.

7
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:17,120
Does this still count?

8
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:19,560
What I say in public naturally counts

9
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:20,560
As long as there is a gift bag

10
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:22,160
I don't care what's in it

11
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:25,240
I guarantee you a four-level door

12
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:27,480
I have hung the gift package on the trading platform

13
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:29,240
The transaction object is specified to be you

14
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:31,560
As long as you help me upgrade to level 4 now

15
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:33,160
The gift bag is yours

16
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:37,190
Fang Bei is very heartbroken.

17
00:00:37,390 --> 00:00:38,430
Afraid that I will be cheated

18
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:42,230
I don’t even dare to take things out and take a sip of water.

19
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:43,950
Open your room upgrade permissions

20
00:00:44,310 --> 00:00:45,350
You stay in this room

21
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:46,550
I'll give you a baby
